#: 6531663210114430aab10723a2daf87f
msgid ""
"Small GPS modules with small backplanes, such as the BN-220, may take a long"
" time to acquire sufficient stability of their velocity and position lock to"
" allow pre-arm checks to pass when using EKF3 in Plane or EKF2 or EKF3 in "
"Copter. Solutions are to either wait however long it takes for pre-arm "
"checks to clear, increase the effective size of the ground plane by putting "
"a larger square of aluminum foil behind the GPS (be careful not to short "
"anything, insulating it from the GPS electronics!), or increase the value of"
" the ``EKFx_CHECK_SCALE`` which controls the tightness of the pre-arm "
"consistency checks to 120 to 150 (this is NOT recommended for Copter)."
msgstr ""
"小背板的小型 GPS 模块（如 BN-220）在使用 Plane 的 EKF3 或 Copter 的 EKF2/EKF3 "
"时，可能需要很长时间才能获得足够稳定的速度和位置锁定以通过解锁前检查。解决方法是：等待解锁前检查通过（无论需要多长时间）、在 GPS "
"背面放一张更大的铝箔来增大有效地平面（注意绝缘，避免短路 GPS 电子元件！），或将 ``EKFx_CHECK_SCALE`` 参数增大至 120 到 "
"150（**不建议用于 Copter**），该参数控制解锁前一致性检查的严格程度。"
